{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101815","id":2286411210,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6IR93K","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101815","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101815.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101815.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101815","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101815/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101815/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101815/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a30410bbf530ea2f06fe33c085649b473f822a8b","number":101815,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Refactor post-step operations in Jolt module to be done as needed","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #101695.\r\nFixes #101721.\r\n\r\nThe general theme of this PR is to remove `JoltObject3D::post_step`, and instead replace whatever previously happened in `JoltBody3D::post_step` and `JoltArea3D::post_step` with more specific operations that are invoked as needed rather than for every active/awake body in the simulation on every physics step.\r\n\r\nWhat mainly prompted this change was that `JoltShapedObject3D::previous_jolt_shape` was until now being cleared as part of `JoltShapedObject3D::post_step`, which worked fine prior to #100983 due to `post_step` always being invoked for every single body, sleeping or otherwise, but as of #100983 `post_step` will only be called for active/awake bodies. This meant that `previous_jolt_shape` would never be cleared for something like `StaticBody3D`, which is always sleeping, leading to the forced `Area3D` enter/exit events emitted by `JoltContactListener3D::_flush_area_shifts` to be queued up every single physics step as opposed to just once.\r\n\r\nThe solution to this is to add a new list in `JoltSpace3D`, called `shapes_changed_list`, that keeps track of any `JoltShapedObject3D` that have changed their shape since the last physics step, and use that list to clear all of their respective `previous_jolt_shape` after we've checked against it in `JoltContactListener3D::post_step`.\r\n\r\nHowever, seeing as how this clearing of `previous_jolt_shape` was the only thing happening in `JoltBody3D::post_step`, we have no need to call it at all for bodies anymore. This meant that the only object being post-stepped was `JoltArea3D`, which currently uses it to check if there are any pending events and queue up the invocation of its `JoltArea3D::call_queries` for the next physics frame if there are, which upon closer inspection wasn't strictly necessary. We may just as well queue up `JoltArea3D::call_queries` as the individual events are being added instead, obviating the need for `JoltArea3D::post_step` (and thus also `JoltObject3D::post_step`) altogether.\r\n\r\nRemoving `JoltArea3D::post_step` also happens to resolve #101695, as `JoltArea3D::post_step` wasn't invoking the base implementation of `JoltShapedObject3D::post_step`, leading to its `previous_jolt_shape` never being cleared either.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":10558797,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AoR1N","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/20","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20/labels","number":20,"state":"closed","title":"4.4","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"h